---
import V5Layout from '../layouts/V5Layout.astro';
const title = "Engage - Start with a 48-hour Prospect Brief | AiRE";
const description = "Every AiRE engagement starts the same way: a US$1,999, 48-hour Prospect Brief - data inventory, deposit-model framework, preliminary prospectivity read and a fixed-price scope.";
const bodyHtml = "\n\n<main>\n<section class=\"page-hero\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow\">Engage</p>\n    <h1>Start small. Start fast. Judge us on output.</h1>\n    <p class=\"lead\">No open-ended discovery calls. Every AiRE engagement - miner, government or investor - begins with the same low-risk first transaction: the 48-hour Prospect Brief. You get a tangible deliverable; we both learn whether the full engagement is worth it.</p>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"section\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"section-head\">\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\">The Prospect Brief \u00b7 US$1,999 \u00b7 48 hours</p>\n      <h2>The first deliverable, not the first meeting.</h2>\n      <p class=\"lead\">Scoped on your ground - your tenement, your data inventory - not a canned demo.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"steps\">\n      <div class=\"step reveal\"><div class=\"s-num\"></div><div><p class=\"s-when\">Day 0 \u00b7 Paper first</p><h3>Mutual NDA execution</h3><p>Ours or yours - we execute whichever confidentiality text your team prefers before any data moves. Confidentiality is the first deliverable.</p></div></div>\n      <div class=\"step reveal\"><div class=\"s-num\"></div><div><p class=\"s-when\">Day 0 \u00b7 Secure handover</p><h3>Data-room handshake</h3><p>Share a secure access link - SharePoint, Box, AWS or your existing virtual data room. No email attachments, no payload limits, no broken uploads. Project outline and commodity focus come with it - even rough.</p></div></div>\n      <div class=\"step reveal\"><div class=\"s-num\"></div><div><p class=\"s-when\">Hours 0-48</p><h3>The council works</h3><p>Data inventory and quality assessment \u00b7 which of the twelve deposit models apply to your geology \u00b7 a preliminary prospectivity framework \u00b7 what your data can support today and what it can&rsquo;t.</p></div></div>\n      <div class=\"step reveal\"><div class=\"s-num\"></div><div><p class=\"s-when\">Hour 48</p><h3>You receive the Prospect Brief</h3><p>A written assessment with a fixed-price, fixed-scope proposal for the full run. If the honest answer is &ldquo;your data can&rsquo;t support this yet,&rdquo; the brief says that - and tells you the cheapest path to fixing it. The brief arrives with a booking link, so the walkthrough call is one click to schedule - no email back-and-forth.</p></div></div>\n      <div class=\"step reveal\"><div class=\"s-num\"></div><div><p class=\"s-when\">Weeks, not seasons</p><h3>The full engagement</h3><p>On go-ahead: the complete CAGE-IN run, ranked targets, maps, sections, 3D viewer and coverage disclosure - through every council gate, ending at G4: your explicit acceptance.</p></div></div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"indicative-note\">Prospect Brief pricing is fixed. Full-engagement pricing is indicative by pathway - see <a class=\"textlink\" href=\"/explorer\">explorer</a>, <a class=\"textlink\" href=\"/government\">government</a> and <a class=\"textlink\" href=\"/investor\">investor</a> - and is confirmed in your brief before any commitment.</p>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"section\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">The deliverable</p><h2>What lands in your inbox at hour 48.</h2></div>\n<div class=\"brief-spec\"><ol class=\"bs-list\">\n<li>Data inventory + a quality grade for each dataset you hold.</li>\n<li>Which of the 12 deposit models fit your geology - and why.</li>\n<li>A preliminary ranked prospectivity read on the ground.</li>\n<li>A coverage map: what your data CAN and CANNOT light up.</li>\n<li>A fixed-scope, fixed-price proposal for the full run.</li>\n<li>A one-click link to book the call.</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"bs-sample\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 560 270\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Evidence coverage disclosure chart showing active and dark evidence layers\">\n            <rect width=\"560\" height=\"270\" fill=\"#10202b\"/>\n            <g font-family=\"Inter,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\">\n              <text x=\"40\" y=\"46\" fill=\"#9fb0b8\" font-weight=\"700\" letter-spacing=\"1.4\">EVIDENCE COVERAGE - DISCLOSED PER RUN</text>\n              <g>\n                <text x=\"40\" y=\"80\" fill=\"#c7d2d7\">alteration spectral suite</text><rect x=\"230\" y=\"70\" width=\"240\" height=\"12\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#9a5630\"/><text x=\"480\" y=\"80\" fill=\"#8aa0ad\">active</text>\n                <text x=\"40\" y=\"108\" fill=\"#c7d2d7\">magnetics + radiometrics</text><rect x=\"230\" y=\"98\" width=\"240\" height=\"12\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#9a5630\"/><text x=\"480\" y=\"108\" fill=\"#8aa0ad\">active</text>\n                <text x=\"40\" y=\"136\" fill=\"#c7d2d7\">geochemistry (multi-element)</text><rect x=\"230\" y=\"126\" width=\"186\" height=\"12\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#b58a1f\"/><text x=\"480\" y=\"136\" fill=\"#e3c465\">partial</text>\n                <text x=\"40\" y=\"164\" fill=\"#8a9aa3\">EM conductivity</text><rect x=\"230\" y=\"154\" width=\"240\" height=\"12\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#22333d\"/><text x=\"480\" y=\"164\" fill=\"#7e919b\">dark \u00b7 no input data</text>\n                <text x=\"40\" y=\"192\" fill=\"#8a9aa3\">structural / lithology map</text><rect x=\"230\" y=\"182\" width=\"240\" height=\"12\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#22333d\"/><text x=\"480\" y=\"192\" fill=\"#7e919b\">dark \u00b7 absent</text>\n              </g>\n              <text x=\"40\" y=\"238\" fill=\"#7e919b\">weight-mass scored: <tspan fill=\"#e3c465\" font-weight=\"700\">78%</tspan> - the remaining 22% is named, not hidden</text>\n            </g>\n          </svg><figcaption>Sample coverage page (redacted) - every brief states what the data could not see.</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section section-alt\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"win-criteria\"><h3>What makes the brief a win - you decide.</h3>\n<div class=\"win-grid\">\n<div class=\"win-q\">Is this ground worth a drill budget?</div>\n<div class=\"win-q\">Where, specifically, would the evidence put the first targets?</div>\n<div class=\"win-q\">How sure can we be - what scored weight-mass backs it?</div>\n<div class=\"win-q\">What&rsquo;s missing, and what would it cost to light it up?</div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"win-yard\">You judge the brief on one thing: is the ranked read defensible against your own knowledge of the ground? Success criteria are agreed in writing before the clock starts.</p></div></div></section>\n\n<!-- ============ BRIEF-REQUEST FORM ============ -->\n<section class=\"section section-alt\" id=\"request-form\">\n  <div class=\"wrap-narrow\">\n    <div class=\"section-head\">\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\">Request the brief</p>\n      <h2>Two minutes of structure. Then the clock is ours.</h2>\n      <p class=\"lead\">Prefer plain email? Write to the founder directly - the form and the inbox start the same Day-0 protocol.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"twoside\">\n      <div class=\"ts-row\"><div class=\"ts-not\">We won&rsquo;t hand you a resource or a grade.</div><div class=\"ts-will\"><b>We will</b> give you defensible, evidence-traced target rankings with every gap named - the inputs your QP needs.</div></div>\n      <div class=\"ts-row\"><div class=\"ts-not\">We won&rsquo;t replace your geologist&rsquo;s sign-off.</div><div class=\"ts-will\"><b>We will</b> hand them a ranked, cited starting point they govern and certify.</div></div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"indicative-note\">Submissions go straight to Dr. Tripathi at <a class=\"textlink\" href=\"mailto:info@geoexplorationllc.com?subject=Prospect%20Brief%20request\">info@geoexplorationllc.com</a> - no mailing lists, no drip campaigns. Prefer plain email? Write to the same address directly.</p>\n    <!-- Lead intake: hosted Google Form (opens in a new tab). Owner notifications deliver each submission to info@geoexplorationllc.com. -->\n    <div class=\"fly-cta\">\n      <a class=\"btn btn-gold\" href=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeFNPr0-H4ky-NaOKsGm2IuuN0wi9w0SYhTsu8GZ2wKBZ5Rlw/viewform\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Open the request form <span class=\"arr\">\u2192</span></a>\n      <p class=\"micro\">Secure intake &middot; goes straight to Dr.&nbsp;Tripathi &middot; or email <a class=\"textlink\" href=\"mailto:info@geoexplorationllc.com?subject=Prospect%20Brief%20request\">info@geoexplorationllc.com</a></p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"section\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"section-head\">\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\">Your data, handled like it matters</p>\n      <h2>Confidentiality is an engineering rule here, not a policy page.</h2>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"feature-cols\">\n      <div class=\"feature reveal\"><div class=\"f-ic\">\u26e8</div><h3>Sovereign by architecture</h3><p>The platform is desktop software. Client data is processed locally - not uploaded to third-party clouds. Government deployments run entirely on your infrastructure.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"feature reveal\"><div class=\"f-ic\">\u2205</div><h3>No credentials, anywhere</h3><p>A standing engineering rule with an automated test enforcing it: no API key, password or token ever appears in code, logs or output files. Your data-room access dies with the project.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"feature reveal\"><div class=\"f-ic\">\u270e</div><h3>Public only by consent</h3><p>Nothing about your project appears in our materials without written consent - and even then, sanitized. The case studies on this site exist under exactly that rule.</p></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"cta-band\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2>Send the first email.</h2>\n    <p>One paragraph about your project and your data is enough to start. Answered personally within two business days; the 48-hour clock starts when the NDA clears.</p>\n    <a class=\"btn btn-gold\" href=\"mailto:info@geoexplorationllc.com?subject=Prospect%20Brief%20request\">Email Dr. Tripathi <span class=\"arr\">\u2192</span></a>\n    <p style=\"margin-top:1.2em;font-size:.85rem\">info@geoexplorationllc.com</p>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"spine-band\"><div class=\"wrap\"><p class=\"spine\">We don&rsquo;t add to your data pile - we <span class=\"hl\">resolve it into a ranked drill decision you can sign and defend.</span></p></div></div>\n</main>\n\n";
---
<V5Layout title={title} description={description}>
<Fragment set:html={bodyHtml} />
</V5Layout>
